ose a Name That Truly Fits</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Explore the fascinating psychology behind pet naming. Learn how names shape your bond, influence behavior, and discover science-backed tips for choosing the perfect pet name.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/best-animal-names-by-habitat/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🌍</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Best Animal Names by Habitat: Forests, Oceans, Deserts &amp; More 🌍</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Discover the perfect animal names inspired by different habitats around the world. From deep ocean dwellers to desert survivors, find names rooted in nature&#x27;s most beautiful landscapes.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/best-animal-names-by-color/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🎨</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Best Animal Names by Color: 200+ Ideas for Every Shade 🎨</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Find the perfect name based on your pet&#x27;s color! From snow-white names to midnight-black names, explore 200+ color-inspired animal names organized by every shade of the rainbow.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/best-animal-names-inspired-by-mythology/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">⚡</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 