 of memorable animal characters. <strong>Lassie</strong> (the iconic collie), <strong>Benji</strong> (scruffy hero), <strong>Beethoven</strong> (the St. Bernard), <strong>Hooch</strong> (Turner & Hooch), <strong>Marley</strong> (Marley & Me). For cats: <strong>Jonesy</strong> (Alien), <strong>Crookshanks</strong> (Harry Potter), <strong>Salem</strong> (Sabrina), <strong>Binx</strong> (Hocus Pocus).\"}}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"TV animal stars: <strong>Eddie</strong> (Frasier), <strong>Wishbone</strong>, <strong>Lassie</strong>, <strong>Comet</strong> (Full House), <strong>Santa's Little Helper</strong> (Simpsons). Animated greats: <strong>Scooby</strong>, <strong>Garfield</strong>, <strong>Snoopy</strong>, <strong>Brian</strong> (Family Guy), <strong>Courage</strong> (Courage the Cowardly Dog), <strong>Appa</strong> (Avatar), <strong>Pikachu</strong>.\"}}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Literary Animal Names 📖\"]}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"9\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"Literature's animal characters live forever in our imaginations. <strong>Hedwig</strong>, <strong>Crookshanks</strong>, <strong>Scabbers</strong>, <strong>Fang</strong>, <strong>Buckbeak</strong>, <strong>Norbert</strong> (Harry Potter). <strong>Aslan</strong> (Narnia), <strong>Wilbur</strong> and <strong>Charlotte</strong> (Charlotte's Web), <strong>Black Beauty</strong>, <strong>White Fang</strong>, <strong>Buck</strong> (Call of the Wild).\"}}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"Classic literary animals: <strong>Moby Dick</strong> (for a large white pet!), <strong>Old Yeller</strong>, <strong>Toto</strong> (Wizard of Oz), <strong>Rikki-Tikki-Tavi</strong>, <strong>Babe</strong> (the sheep-pig). Poetry and plays: <strong>Gus</strong> (the theatre cat from Cats), <strong>Growltiger</strong>, <strong>Rum Tum Tugger</strong>. Recent hits: <strong>Katniss</strong> (Hunger Games), <strong>Ghost</strong> (Game of Thrones direwolf).\"}}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"11\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Internet-Famous Animal Names 📱\"]}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"The internet age has produced a new generation of famous animals. <strong>Grumpy Cat</strong> (Tardar Sauce), <strong>Lil Bub</strong>, <strong>Maru</strong> (box-loving cat), <strong>Juniper</strong> the fox, <strong>Marnie</strong> the dog, <strong>Doug the Pug</strong>, <strong>Menswear Dog</strong>, <strong>Nala Cat</strong>, <strong>Smoothie</strong> the cat.\"}}]\n30:[\"$\",\"p\",\"13\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"Viral sensations: <strong>Cheems</strong> (the Shiba Inu meme), <strong>Doge</strong> (Kabosu), <strong>Walter</strong> (the bull terrier), <strong>Pusheen</strong>, <strong>Gabe</strong> the dog, <strong>Tuna</strong> (the chiweenie). These names carry immediate recognition for anyone who spends time online, making them great conversation starters.\"}}]\n31:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"14\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Historical Animal Names 📜\"]}]\n32:[\"$\",\"p\",\"15\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"Real animals have made genuine history. <strong>Laika</strong> (first dog in space), <strong>Balto</strong> and <strong>Togo</strong> (serum run heroes), <strong>Cher Ami</strong> (WWI hero pigeon), <strong>Sergeant Stubby</strong> (most decorated WWI dog). <strong>Hachiko</strong>, the loyal Akita who waited at the train station, represents ultimate devotion.\"}}]\n33:[\"$\",\"p\",\"16\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"Presidential pets: <strong>Bo</strong> and <strong>Sunny</strong> (Obamas' Portuguese Water Dogs), <strong>Buddy</strong> and <strong>Socks</strong> (Clintons' pets), <strong>Fala</strong> (FDR's Scottie). Scientific pioneers: <strong>Koko</strong> (sign-language gorilla), <strong>Alex</strong> (talking parrot), <strong>Dolly</strong> (cloned sheep). These names honor real animal achievements.\"}}]\n34:[\"$\",\"p\",\"17\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Discover more naming ideas: \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"28\",{\"href\":\"/animal/ojos-azules/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Ojos Azules\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"43\",{\"href\":\"/animal/curassow/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Curassow\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"55\",{\"href\":\"/animal/penguin/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Penguin\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"66\",{\"href\":\"/animal/ladybug/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Ladybug\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"77\",{\"href\":\"/animal/highlander/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Highlander\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", and hundreds more animal name generators.\"]}]\n35:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"❓ Frequently Asked Questions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Is it okay to name my pet after a famous animal?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Absolutely! It's one of the most popular naming approaches. Famous namesakes give pets instant personality and provide a great story to share with others who recognize the reference.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Will my pet live up to its famous name?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Probably not — and that's part of the fun. A hamster named Simba or a cat named Scooby creates an ironic contrast that makes the name even more endearing.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Which famous animal names are most popular?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Simba, Nala, Loki, Thor, Luna, and Shadow are consistently among the most popular pop-culture pet names. Disney names dominate, followed by Marvel/Star Wars references.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Should I consider copyright or trademark issues?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"For personal pet names, there are absolutely no legal concerns. You can name your cat Mickey Mouse or your dog Harry Potter without any issues — it's your personal pet!\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n36:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"🐾 Related Animal Name Generators\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"dog\",{\"href\":\"/animal/dog/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐕\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Dog\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"cat\",{\"href\":\"/animal/cat/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐱\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Cat\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"lion\",{\"href\":\"/animal/lion/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🦁\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Lion\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"tiger\",{\"href\":\"/animal/tiger/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐯\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Tiger\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"gerbil\",{\"href\":\"/animal/gerbil/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-pr