amp</strong> and <strong>Lady</strong> (Lady and the Tramp), <strong>Pongo</strong> and <strong>Perdita</strong> (101 Dalmatians), <strong>Copper</strong> (Fox and the Hound), <strong>Dug</strong> (Up), <strong>Bolt</strong>, <strong>Pluto</strong>, <strong>Goofy</strong>.\"}}]\ne:[\"$\",\"p\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"Cat names from Disney: <strong>Simba</strong>, <strong>Nala</strong>, <strong>Mufasa</strong>, <strong>Sarabi</strong> (Lion King), <strong>Duchess</strong>, <strong>Toulouse</strong>, <strong>Berlioz</strong>, <strong>Marie</strong> (Aristocats), <strong>Figaro</strong> (Pinocchio), <strong>Lucifer</strong> (Cinderella). Other Disney animals: <strong>Bambi</strong>, <strong>Thumper</strong>, <strong>Flower</strong>, <strong>Dumbo</strong>, <strong>Baloo</strong>, <strong>Bagheera</strong>, <strong>Meeko</strong>, <strong>Pascal</strong>.\"}}]\nf:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Movie & TV Animal Names 🎬\"]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"p\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"Beyond Disney, cinema is full of memorable animal characters. <strong>Lassie</strong> (the iconic collie), <strong>Benji</strong> (scruffy hero), <strong>Beethoven</strong> (the St. Bernard), <strong>Hooch</strong> (Turner & Hooch), <strong>Marley</strong> (Marley & Me). For cats: <strong>Jonesy</strong> (Alien), <strong>Crookshanks</strong> (Harry Potter), <strong>Salem</strong> (Sabrina), <strong>Binx</strong> (Hocus Pocus).\"}}]\n11:[\"$\",\"p\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"TV animal stars: <strong>Eddie</strong> (Frasier), <strong>Wishbone</strong>, <strong>Lassie</strong>, <strong>Comet</strong> (Full House), <strong>Santa's Little Helper</strong> (Simpsons). Animated greats: <strong>Scooby</strong>, <strong>Garfield</strong>, <strong>Snoopy</strong>, <strong>Brian</strong> (Family Guy), <strong>Courage</strong> (Courage the Cowardly Dog), <strong>Appa</strong> (Avatar), <strong>Pikachu</strong>.\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Literary Animal Names 📖\"]}]\n13:[\"$\",\"p\",\"9\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"Literature's animal characters live forever in our imaginations. <strong>Hedwig</strong>, <strong>Crookshanks</strong>, <strong>Scabbers</strong>, <strong>Fang</strong>, <strong>Buckbeak</strong>, <strong>Norbert</strong> (Harry Potter). <strong>Aslan</strong> (Narnia), <strong>Wilbur</strong> and <strong>Charlotte</strong> (Charlotte's Web), <strong>Black Beauty</strong>, <strong>White Fang</strong>, <strong>Buck</strong> (Call of the Wild).\"}}]\n14:[\"$\",\"p\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"Classic literary animals: <strong>Moby Dick</strong> (for a large white pet!), <strong>Old Yeller</strong>, <strong>Toto</strong> (Wizard of Oz), <strong>Rikki-Tikki-Tavi</strong>, <strong>Babe</strong> (the sheep-pig). Poetry and plays: <strong>Gus</strong> (the theatre cat from Cats), <strong>Growltiger</strong>, <strong>Rum Tum Tugger</strong>. Recent hits: <strong>Katniss</strong> (Hunger Games), <strong>Ghost</strong> (Game of Thrones direwolf).\"}}]\n15:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"11\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Internet-Famous Animal Names 📱\"]}]\n16:[\"$\",\"p\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"The internet age has produced a new generation of famous animals. <strong>Grumpy Cat</strong> (Tardar Sauce), <strong>Lil Bub</strong>, <strong>Maru</strong> (box-loving cat), <strong>Juniper</strong> the fox, <strong>Marnie</strong> the dog, <strong>Doug the Pug</